        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Side Pocket 3 is a Japan-exclusive pocket billiards video game for the PlayStation and Sega Saturn. Like its predecessor, Side Pocket 2, it features the in-game likeness of a real-life professional pool player. In this case, it's JPBA member, Kyoko Sone.\n\nUnlike the prior installments in the Side Pocket series, Side Pocket 3 renders the pool room environment with 3D polygons. In spite of this, the table can still be viewed in a traditional, top-down fashion.\n\nPlay modes consist of: story mode, training mode, trick game mode, and versus mode. Game variants include: eight ball, nine ball, rotation, 14.1 continuous, bowlliards, cutthroat, three ball, poker, pocket game, mitsudama, and yotsudama.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Side Pocket 3 es un videojuego de billar de bolsillo exclusivo de Japón para PlayStation y Sega Saturn. Al igual que su predecesor, Side Pocket 2, presenta la representación dentro del juego de una persona real que juega billar profesionalmente: Kyoko Sone, integrante de la JPBA.\n\nA diferencia de las entregas anteriores de la serie Side Pocket, Side Pocket 3 representa el salón de billar con entornos 3D poligonales. Aun así, la mesa sigue pudiendo verse de forma tradicional, desde arriba.\n\nLos modos de juego son: modo historia, modo entrenamiento, modo de juegos de trucos y modo versus. Las variantes de juego incluyen: bola 8, bola 9, rotación, 14.1 continuo, bowlliards, cutthroat, tres bolas, póker, pocket game, mitsudama y yotsudama.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1997",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
